When asked to review Renovate PRs or run vacation dependency maintenance, read `.cursor/automations/renovate-pr-review.md` and follow it.

Do not merge major bumps without verifying Android CI. Pin incompatible Android deps in `renovate.json` instead of leaving failed PRs open.
